msgstr "For å hindre at skjermen vert dimma:"

#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: C/power-whydim.page:55
msgid ""
"Switch the <gui>Dim Screen</gui> switch to off in the <gui>Power Saving "
"Options</gui> section."
msgstr ""
"Slå av <gui>Demp skjermen</gui>-brytaren i <gui>Power Saving "
