"skjermtidsopptak."

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/shell-wellbeing.page:71
msgid ""
"To limit your daily device use, switch <gui>Screen Time Limit</gui> to on "
"and set a <gui>Daily Limit</gui>. When the limit is reached, you will "
